  "name": "Rite of the Forest",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)This family contains **7 distinct workings**. Each one has its own exact offerings, circles, power, and conditions; use the card belonging to the result you intend.[#]()",
      "title": "Rite of the Forest",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)The offered sapling determines the grove. The rite makes one planting attempt each second, with 59 attempts inside a 20-block radius before Coven bonuses. Every nearby Coven witch adds 2 blocks of radius and 5 attempts.[#]()",
      "title": "How It Unfolds",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": false,
      "text": "[#](53341a)A Bound Waystone moves the whole working to its bound location. The rite pauses while its caster or either end's chunks are unavailable; breaking its sustaining circle aborts it and returns the consumed offerings.[#]()",
      "title": " ",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
    {
      "type": "modonomicon:text",
      "anchor": "",
      "condition": {
        "type": "modonomicon:none"
      },
      "show_title_separator": true,
      "text": "[#](53341a)Grow a forest, replace the sapling for the desired type.[#]() [#](53341a)**Required offerings:** **Oak Sapling**, **Wicker Bundle**, **Brew of Sprouting**, **Ent Twig**.[#]() [#](53341a)**Optional focus:** **Bound Waystone**. Optional items have a gold frame on the rite card.[#]()",
      "title": "Oak forest",
      "use_markdown_in_title": false
    },
